From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anthoine Bourgeois <anthoine.bourgeois@vates.tech>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 09:50:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tapdisk: nbdserver: fixes the error check of posix_memalign

posix_memalign returns an error number, not -1.

Signed-off-by: Anthoine Bourgeois <anthoine.bourgeois@vates.tech>
---
 drivers/tapdisk-nbdserver.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/tapdisk-nbdserver.c b/drivers/tapdisk-nbdserver.c
index d024cc51..86a271d2 100644
--- a/drivers/tapdisk-nbdserver.c
+++ b/drivers/tapdisk-nbdserver.c
@@ -1225,7 +1225,7 @@ static td_vbd_request_t *create_request_vreq(
 	memcpy(req->id, request.handle, sizeof(request.handle));
 
 	rc = posix_memalign(&req->iov.base, 512, len);
-	if (rc < 0) {
+	if (rc != 0) {
 		ERR("posix_memalign failed (%d)", rc);
 		goto fail;
 	}
